: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">そして、改めましてhot stuffさん&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">40周年おめでとうございます🎉&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今回は本当にありがとうございました。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これからもよろしくお願い致します！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-27/26582_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5848.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">次のライブも楽しみになってきた♫</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later ✩*.ﾟ#75</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: norm